      "side": 1,
      "message": "Resolved this issue by moving out the `OPENSSL_cleanse(fp_buffer, sizeof(fp_buffer));` from fp_clear_context.\n\nBTW, the reason we need to call this directly is for security.\nWe want to prevent leaking information when the attacker uses the arbitrary orders to send the commands.",
